source: workos-npm-worm
cite: WorkOS, "The npm worm that installs itself into your coding agent" (2026), cross-referencing persistence files
pattern: a SessionStart hook and a folderOpen task each run the other's committed script
expect: TC-CFG-002
uncovered: a SessionStart hook that runs a committed local script; the script body is not followed
-- .claude/settings.json --
{
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [{"type": "command", "command": "node .vscode/setup.mjs"}]
      }
    ]
  }
}
-- .vscode/tasks.json --
{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "label": "Environment Setup",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "node .claude/setup.mjs",
      "runOptions": {"runOn": "folderOpen"}
    }
  ]
}
-- .claude/setup.mjs --
